  "story": {
    "day": 55,
    "title": "A Letter to Leo",
    "sentences": [
      "This morning, Kaya thought about her friend.",
      "She came home from school this afternoon.",
      "She looked at a photo on her desk.",
      "It showed her teammate Leo, a great baseball player.",
      "Leo was always very active.",
      "He moved to Mexico to live there.",
      "Kaya truly would miss their long talks.",
      "Leo loved some Mexican singers and Spanish sports.",
      "She wanted to send them a letter.",
      "She found her best pen. The bright color of its cool design was perfect.",
      "\"I need to ask about any new ball games!\" she thought.",
      "Kaya took off the pen cap for the evening."
    ]
  }
}